topic.para:
Kernel messages and messages of system services registered with &systemd;
are logged in the &systemd; journal (see
). The journal also forwards
messages to rsyslog, which writes
most of them to plain-text files under the /var/log
directory. &selnx; messages are logged
separately, in /var/log/audit/audit.log. For details,
refer to &selnx;
troubleshooting&selnx;
troubleshooting.
